@startuml
[*] --> Order
Order --> Preparation : delivered
Arrival --> Preparation
Preparation --> Operations : condition and schedule allow
Preparation --> Maintenance : condition and schedule require
Operations --> Maintenance : no more scheduled flights
Operations --> Operations : still has scheduled flights
Maintenance --> Preparation : checked and serviced
Maintenance --> [*] : plane out of service
Preparation --> [*] : plane permanently withdrawn
@enduml
